how to use this thing
1. normal 1 file kernel thing
to run a kernel inside root kernel.cu
run 
modal run run.py 
2. to run kernel in custom file use this 
modal run run.py --kernel path\to\yours.cu
3. to change gpu either chnage from run.py or use --gpu <gpu_name> 
e.g
modal run run.py --kernel path\to\yours.cu --gpu H100